  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A circle in the <em>xy</em>-plane has the equation <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x minus 13 right parenthesis squared plus left parenthesis y minus k right parenthesis squared equals 64\"><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></math>. Which of the following gives the center of the circle and its radius?</p>",
  "answerOptions": [
