      "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The center is at <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 13 comma k right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and the radius is&nbsp;<math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math>.</p>"
